OL,3,GNEWSAMetal bird sculpture stolen from
OL,4,Aart exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating the suspected
OL,7,Ftheft of a sculpture from an art
OL,8,Fexhibition at Eden Court Theatre in
OL,9,FInverness.
OL,11,FThe figure of a bird, made of scrap
OL,12,Fmetal by artist Helen Denerley, is
OL,13,Fthought to have been stolen at some
OL,14,Fpoint between 9 and 13 October.
OL,16,FIt was due to be sold following the
OL,17,Fexhibition for the Scottish Mental
OL,18,FHealth Arts Festival to help raise
OL,19,Fmoney for the Highland-based mental
OL,20,Fhealth charity Centred Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
