OL,3,GNEWSAMetal bird sculpture stolen from
OL,4,Aart exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said inquiries were
OL,7,Fongoing about the missing artwork which
OL,8,Fhad an estimated value of about #850.
